          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "DK yarn gives a lightweight, washable cover suitable for sofas or bedrooms. Plan around 200 m of main colour and 50 m of contrast per side."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
